{"title": "Breakout trader levels", "type": "Trader levels", "hooks": ["One fake breakout, five levels of trader. Which are you?", "Five levels of trader meet the same breakout candle.", "Every level of trader, tested by one fake breakout.", "Which trader are you when the breakout fails?"], "scenes": [{"kind": "hook", "vo": "One fake breakout, five levels of trader. Which are you?", "text": "Five traders, one breakout", "chart": 0, "win": [20, 115], "show": 90}, {"kind": "stick", "head": "Level 1: The chaser", "chart": null, "vo": "Level one sees a green candle and buys it. No plan, no stop, just vibes.", "figures": [{"pose": "stand", "label": "Level 1", "color": "amber"}], "cues": [{"say": "buys it", "do": "pose", "fig": 0, "pose": "happy"}, {"say": "just vibes", "do": "bubble", "fig": 0, "text": "Green means go!"}]}, {"kind": "stick", "head": "Level 2: The jumpy one", "chart": null, "vo": "Level two buys, then sells on the first red candle. Then buys again. Then sells again.", "figures": [{"pose": "happy", "label": "Level 2", "color": "white"}], "cues": [{"say": "sells on the first red candle", "do": "pose", "fig": 0, "pose": "panic"}, {"say": "Then buys again", "do": "pose", "fig": 0, "pose": "happy"}, {"say": "Then sells again", "do": "bubble", "fig": 0, "text": "Not again"}]}, {"kind": "stick", "head": "Level 3: The volume fan", "chart": 0, "show": 89, "vo": "Level three waits for HearthHaven to close above the twenty candle high, on 1.3 times the average volume. Buys.", "figures": [{"pose": "think", "label": "Level 3", "color": "teal"}], "cues": [{"say": "Level three waits", "do": "line", "price": 6.9, "label": "20-candle high", "tone": "amber"}, {"say": "close above the twenty candle high", "do": "reveal", "to": 90}, {"say": "1.3 times the average volume", "do": "pose", "fig": 0, "pose": "point"}, {"say": "Buys", "do": "bubble", "fig": 0, "text": "Textbook breakout"}], "win": [20, 115]}, {"kind": "stick", "head": "Then it fell back", "chart": 0, "show": 90, "